comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-10T19:23:32.361Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check searched all statuses for summarizeResult (3 hits) and command_finish (14 hits) and telemetry undefined (33 complete keyword hits). Read pm-ntr0 and pm-q9yt in full: they concern completed payload bounding work rather than absent-value event loss. Reuse pm-5oj5 parent and those design relationships. Live observed docs 5 starts with no finishes and files 10 starts with 1 finish before this repair; no private payloads or identifiers recorded."
  "2026-09-10T19:24:57.737Z","harness:codex","TDD negative control: both redacted and max capture tests received only command_start over real local HTTP before the fix. The runtime now omits undefined sanitized object values before byte measurement while retaining explicit null and sensitive-key redaction. The regression checks matching process events, successful outcome, one real OTLP request and empty physical queues; no network or runtime functions are mocked."
  "2026-09-10T19:27:52.251Z","harness:codex","Live verification after rebuilding: backend query found matching completion events in the same process session for all four fresh starts (context, docs, files and stats). Linked suite passed 46 tests, including two real network regressions. Earlier missing events cannot be reconstructed and are not being backfilled; this verifies newly executed actions only."
  "2026-09-10T19:35:19.761Z","harness:codex","Final verification: all 8699 tests in 666 files passed. Exact coverage is Statements 64137/64137, Branches 48840/48840, Functions 13331/13331 and Lines 61452/61452. All typecheck projects and focused ESLint passed; staged secret scan passed. Manual packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx consumers passed. Live Sentry/telemetry release gate passed with zero critical/high issues and zero missing error classification. Logical post-fix events were paired for all fresh observed action sessions."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-10T19:27:53.751Z","harness:codex",Completion transport can silently fail despite successful command output when diagnostic serialization throws inside a best-effort catch. Verify paired logical events and physical queues with real transport; count start and finish by process identity because command namespaces may normalize during dispatch.
